Release general-v1: Whisper small by OpenAI
------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Whisper (small)
  Copyright (c) 2022 OpenAI
  MIT License (LICENSE, part 2)
  https://github.com/openai/whisper

The encoder and the decoder are the int8 ONNX export of the sherpa-onnx
project (k2-fsa), without a change:
https://huggingface.co/csukuangfj/sherpa-onnx-whisper-small
(commit 8f3c18b358db4d1f2fc1eae49d75cd20989e4309).

Change made for Transly: whisper-small-tokens.txt is the token table of
that export (small-tokens.txt), with one change. Each token that is not
valid UTF-8 on its own stores every non-ASCII byte b as the character
U+F700 + b. The token ids and the token bytes are otherwise the same.
The changed file is distributed under the same MIT License.

